OAR
https://github.com/botiverse/oar
Upstream package: @botiverse/oar 0.92.0, Apache-2.0.

Dudu builds a modified copy from the official npm dependency and the patches in
@dudu/oar-adapter 0.1.0. Changes cover Claude opening
cancellation and configuration/permission readback, Codex child attribution,
native background task controls, and process ownership on terminating signals.
The original OAR license and upstream attribution are retained.
See @dudu/oar-adapter/README.md and upstream.json for provenance and maintenance.
